---
title: Hot Chip Dip
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Appetizers & Dips
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@sour cream{1%16-oz carton}
@finely chopped green pepper{1/3%c}
@chopped walnuts or pecans{2/3%c}
@finely chopped onion{1%small}
@garlic salt{1%Dash}
@cream cheese{1%12-oz pkg}
@butter{1%tsp}
@salt{1/2%tsp}
@chipped beef{4.5%oz}
@pepper{1%Dash}

Mix everything but the sour cream and nuts. When well mixed, fold in sour cream and nuts. Bake at 350 degrees until hot and bubbly. Serve hot with crackers.
